For the purposes of the first paragraph, point (a), of this Article, obliged entities covered by Article 74 shall collect information in order to determine whether the intended use of high value goods referred to in that Article is for commercial or non-commercial purposes.","content_sha256":"2db6da7aede9ba3da982d476e3c7a56dd36ce61f0cd1413d3e4585959ef92288","rank":0.4250894064088848},{"passage_id":"PL-AML art. 2 ust. 2 pkt 22","doc_id":"PL-AML","article":"2","paragraph":"2","heading":null,"text":"transakcji okazjonalnej – rozumie się przez to transakcję, która nie jest przeprowadzana w ramach stosunków gospodarczych;","content_sha256":"3507caeb2085422e52c3ac0ee6e162c76762b4b78a39a4157725861155b58605","rank":0.3897768367172836},{"passage_id":"PL-AML art. 43 ust. 4","doc_id":"PL-AML","article":"43","paragraph":"4","heading":null,"text":"W przypadku ujawnienia transakcji:
1) skomplikowanych lub
